  "description": "THE ARIZER AIR VAPORIZER\n\nREPLACED BY ARIZER AIR SE\n\nARIZER AIR MAX NOW AVAILABLE\nEVERYTHING YOU LIKED ABOUT THE AIR TO THE MAX\n\nALL PARTS IN STOCK – Glass tubes, screens, batteries, Chargers, etc.\n\nThe Arizer Air vaporizer was designed to have all the vapor quality and power of the Arizer Solo desktop vaporizer without the large, clunky design.\n\nThe Arizer designers succeeded in their mission, creating just that; the Arizer Air vaporizer has all the same Arizer quality in a more compact design with swappable batteries.\n\nThe Arizer Air is perfect for a first-time user looking for a great product that is super easy to use.\n\nThe Arizer Air Vaporizer’s Features:\n\n- Sleek, light design conveniently fits in the palm of your hand, pocket or purse.\n\n- A powerful hybrid heating element that heats up in a timely manner.\n\n- Digital display.\n\n- Extended battery life that provides up to an hour of extended use.\n\n- Easy one-button operation for temperature control and power.\n\n- Toxin-free high-quality ceramic heating chamber and glass parts.\n\n- Variable temperature settings allow you to produce a smooth or potent dry herb vapor, you choose!\n\n- Easily interchangeable batteries that can be swapped with fully charged spare batteries\n\nThis device includes:\n\n- 1 x Warming unit with replaceable battery\n\n- 1 x Charger / Power Adapter and Charging Port\n\n- 2 x Glass Stems\n\n- 1 x Glass Aroma Dish\n\n- 1 x Portable Package\n\n- 1 x Clear Protective Silicone Skin\n\n- 1 x Stainless Steel Stirring Tool\n\n- 2 x Air Glass Aroma Tube (70mm) Stem Caps\n\nEasy to Use\nUltra portable and discreet\nGreat vapor production\n5 Temperature Settings\n10 Minute Auto Shut Off Timer\nCeramic Heating Element\nCan be used while charging\nHeats up in 1-2 minutes\n\nDETAILS\n\nDimensions: 122 mm in Height, 29 mm in Diameter\nThe Arizer Air includes:\n1 x Warming unit with battery\n1 x Charger / Power Adapter\n2 x Glass Diffuser Stems\n1 x Glass Aroma Dish\n1 x Carrying Case\n1 x Clear Protective Silicone Skin\n1 x Stainless Steel Stirring Tool\n2 x Aroma Tube Stem Caps\n\nWARRANTY\n\nSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSave",
  "description_html": "<p><strong>THE ARIZER AIR VAPORIZER</strong></p>\n<p><strong>REPLACED BY ARIZER AIR SE</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://vaporizers.ca/products/arizer-air-max-portable-vaporizer-taxes-extra\" title=\"Arizer Air Max\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ARIZER AIR MAX</a> NOW AVAILABLE<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">EVERYTHING YOU LIKED ABOUT THE AIR TO THE MAX<br /></strong></p>\n<p>ALL PARTS IN STOCK &#8211; Glass tubes, screens, batteries, Chargers, etc.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">The Arizer Air vaporizer was designed to have all the vapor quality and power of the Arizer Solo desktop vaporizer without the large, clunky design. </p>\n<p>The Arizer designers succeeded in their mission, creating just that;  the Arizer Air vaporizer has all the same Arizer quality in a more compact design with swappable batteries. </span></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">The Arizer Air is perfect for a first-time user looking for a great product that is super easy to use.</span></p>\n<h5 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><b data-mce-fragment=\"1\">The Arizer Air Vaporizer&#8217;s Features:</b></h5>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Sleek, light design conveniently fits in the palm of your hand, pocket or purse.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">A powerful hybrid heating element that heats up in a timely manner.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Digital display.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Extended battery life that provides up to an hour of extended use.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Easy one-button operation for temperature control and power.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Toxin-free high-quality ceramic heating chamber and glass parts.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Variable temperature settings allow you to produce a smooth or potent dry herb vapor, you choose!</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Easily interchangeable batteries that can be swapped with fully charged spare batteries</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><b data-mce-fragment=\"1\">This device includes:</b></p>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1 x Warming unit with replaceable battery</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1 x Charger / Power Adapter and Charging Port</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">2 x Glass Stems</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1 x Glass Aroma Dish</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1 x Portable Package</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1 x Clear Protective Silicone Skin</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1 x Stainless Steel Stirring Tool</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">2 x Air Glass Aroma Tube (70mm) Stem Caps</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"http://vaporizers.ca/pages/review-arizer-air-portable-vaporizer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0266/5065/files/button-readourreview_large.jpg?v=1508355401\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>Easy to Use<br />Ultra portable and discreet<br />Great vapor production<br />5 Temperature Settings<br />10 Minute Auto Shut Off Timer<br />Ceramic Heating Element<br />Can be used while charging<br />Heats up in 1-2 minutes</p>\n<h5></h5>\n<p><img style=\"float: left\" alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0266/5065/files/Arizer-Air-Features_large.jpg?v=1479313787\"></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>   </p>\n<table style=\"width: 659px\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 37.7333px\">\n<td style=\"width: 626.433px;height: 37.7333px\">\n<h5>DETAILS</h5>\n<p> Dimensions: 122 mm in Height, 29 mm in Diameter<br />The Arizer Air includes:<br />1 x Warming unit with battery<br />1 x Charger / Power Adapter<br />2 x Glass Diffuser Stems<br />1 x Glass Aroma Dish<br />1 x Carrying Case<br />1 x Clear Protective Silicone Skin<br />1 x Stainless Steel Stirring Tool<br />2 x Aroma Tube Stem Caps</td>\n<td style=\"width: 403.567px;height: 37.7333px;text-align: left\"><img style=\"float: none;display: block;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto\" alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0266/5065/files/Air-Size-122mmby29mm_medium.png?v=1478805856\"> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h5>WARRANTY</h5>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><a href=\"https://vaporizers.ca/pages/arizer-warranty-information\"><img style=\"float: none;display: block;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto\" alt=\"Warranty Information\" src=\"//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0266/5065/files/warranty_6743b620-f6e8-485f-a92d-8f39f238